tcomes may include  barring smith from attending future  events including the 2023 oscars or  stripping him of his academy membership  according to the hollywood reporter  there was an emergency phone call the  morning after the ceremony with the  academy's board of governors but the  issue will likely be settled at the next  full meeting of the board as the first  such conference following the oscars  usually addresses any issues which took  place during the event the academy seems  reluctant to strip smith of his best  actor oscar citing chris rock's refusal  to press criminal charges against smith  academy governor whoopi goldberg weighed  in on the view we're not going to take  that oscar from him well we're not going  to say there's consequences to well  there will be consequences i'm sure  notably while the academy's recently  implemented code of conduct stipulates  that members must not violate recognized  standards of decency there is no formal  procedure for rescinding an award after  it has been presented as the academy  works to determine the best course of  action the social media world has lit up  with thoughts on both the given  statements and what the next steps  should be on one side some believe that  will smith should not only be held  accountable for his actions but he  should face a strong punishment as well  one twitter user posted the most public  stance that they can take is to ban him  from next year's oscars no exceptions  another user agreed posting don't take  his oscar but a public reprimand and  revoke of membership so there's  permanent loss of privileges on the  other hand more than a few people have  taken the time to vocally side with  smith as the academy continues to assess  the situation users have posted in  defense of smith with tweets like y'all  leave this man alone he was defending  his wife and nobody was there for a  roast he shouldn't have gone after jada  and smith was wrong to hit him but he  was also wrong to say what he did it  wasn't funny at all regardless of where  you may stand on it the will smith chris  rock ordeal has become nothing if not  messy all we can do is wait and see how  the academy chooses to follow up in the  wake of this polarizing incident check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about the  latest hot topics are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

